{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44940","headline":"荅苏州韦应物郎中 · 皎然","name":"荅苏州韦应物郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗教殆沦缺，庸音互相倾。\n忽观风骚韵，会我夙昔情。\n荡漾学海资，郁爲诗人英。\n格将寒松高，气与秋江清。\n何必邺中作，可爲千载程。\n受辞分虎竹，万里临江城。\n到日扫烦政，况今休黩兵。\n应怜禅家子，林下寂无营。\n迹隳世上华，心得道中精。\n脱畧文字累，免爲外物撄。\n书衣流埃积，砚石駮藓生。\n恨未识君子，空传手中琼。\n安可诱我性，始愿愆素诚。\n爲无鸑鷟音，继公云和笙。\n吟之向禅薮，反媿幽松声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}